                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">Please upload a photo of your actual Philippine ID (Driver's License, National ID, PhilHealth ID, Postal ID, etc.).</p>
                            <p class="mb-0 mt-2">Screenshots, photos of screens, or other documents will be rejected.</p>
